Package: glinty
Type: Package
Title: Tiny Reactive Web Application Framework
Version: 0.0.5.21
Authors@R: c(
    person("Troy", "Hernandez", email = "troy@cornball.ai",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-4248-604X")),
    person("cornball.ai", role = "cph"))
Description: Build interactive web applications in R with a pure base R
    reactive engine, a semantic component vocabulary, and a built-in
    HTTP and 'WebSocket' server implemented on base R sockets.
    Session-scoped inputs, outputs, observers, and reactive
    expressions. The wire carries components rather than markup, so a
    frontend that is not a browser can render the same application:
    a small hand-written JavaScript client ships here, and a Flutter
    client reads the same trees. No build tools. Alpha: the API and
    the wire protocol are not yet stable.
